From 80c3ca1a77ec8bd5c8d874fa0918b144ae2bb5db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 21:00:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] pmdomain: mediatek: add MT6878 MM_INFRA and DISP

Add a bounded hardware-voter path to the generic MediaTek provider and
describe the MT6878 MM_INFRA parent and DISP child with exact Nothing OS
4.1 offsets. MM_INFRA uses HWCCF SMC 0x540 around its vote; DISP uses the
SPM control register, SRAM handshake and MMSYS bus protection.

No power-domain DT nodes are enabled by this patch.

Signed-off-by: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../power/mediatek,power-controller.yaml      |   7 +
 drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/mt6878-pm-domains.h |  31 +++
 drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/mtk-pm-domains.c    | 205 +++++++++++++++++-
 drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/mtk-pm-domains.h    |   9 +
 include/linux/soc/mediatek/mtk_sip_svc.h      |   3 +
 5 files changed, 250 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

